%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE -- the seven steps of God's plan and where the Gospels stand
%% (BOOK-SPEC step numbering; 00a-gods-plan.md is the authoritative chapter).
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterRoyal} 神的計劃七步 \textperiodcentered\ The Seven Steps of God's Plan}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
整本聖經只有一條線：\textbf{\color{GloryGold!80!black}神要與人同住}。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
The whole Bible runs on one line:\\
God means to \textbf{dwell} with man.\\[0.4em]
\small\upshape\color{ChapterRoyal} 編者對全經的概括 \textperiodcentered\ the editor's summary of the whole canon
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{0.9cm}p{3.6cm}p{7.6cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{步} & \textbf{名稱} & \textbf{範圍} \\
\midrule
一 & 創造與墮落 & 創世記 1–11 \\
二 & 應許與揀選 & 創世記 12–50 \\
三 & 救贖、立約與同住 & 出埃及記–申命記 \\
四 & 進入、王與殿 & 約書亞記–列王紀、歷代志、詩篇、箴言、傳道書、雅歌 \\
五 & 先知、被擄與歸回 & 以賽亞書–瑪拉基書 \\
\textbf{\color{JesusRed}六} & \textbf{\color{JesusRed}基督來臨} & \textbf{\color{JesusRed}四福音（本書卷一至卷八）} \\
\textbf{\color{GloryGold!80!black}七} & \textbf{\color{GloryGold!80!black}教會與再來} & \textbf{\color{GloryGold!80!black}使徒行傳至啟示錄（本書卷九）} \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterRoyal} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
每一站先問兩件事：這是耶穌一生的第幾站？這是神整個計劃的第幾步？\\
然後帶著一個問題讀完：這一站，我看見耶穌是誰？\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
Each station asks two things first: where is this in the life of Jesus, and where is it
in the plan of God? Then read with one question: at this station, whom do I see in Jesus?}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
